  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Light sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> During combat, as a swift action, you may spend a spell point to expel a blast of light seen only by one ally that can see you who has not yet acted in combat. That ally may use your current initiative in place of their own as if they had rolled it. If used during a surprise round, that ally is no longer surprised.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/light#toc76\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
